Scope and third-party attributions

This license covers the source code AND the trained model weights published in
this repository (models/ortho-v1/). The weights were trained on third-party
open data, which must be credited when the weights or their outputs are reused:

- Aerial photographs: "IGN - BD ORTHO historique 1950-1965", Institut national
  de l'information géographique et forestière (IGN), Licence Ouverte /
  Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab).
- Training labels (track axes) derived from:
  - OpenStreetMap, © OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database License
    (ODbL) 1.0, https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  - IGN BD TOPO, Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab).
- Encoder initialisation: ImageNet-pretrained ResNet-34 weights from
  torchvision (BSD 3-Clause License).
